# B1 "Urshilaku Nerevarine": with Moon-and-Star, Sul-Matuul gives his counsel,
# speaks of need and duty, and names the player Urshilaku Nerevarine.
# PositionCell stands in for the walk.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from b1_urshilaku
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Each answer names the next topic: counsel, then need and duty, then the
# naming itself.
case b1_urshilaku
run
player->PositionCell 47 380 -185 0 "Urshilaku Camp, Ashkhan's Yurt"
until 600 GetPCCell "Urshilaku Camp, Ashkhan's Yurt" == 1
talk sul-matuul
ask Urshilaku Nerevarine
ask counsel of Sul-Matuul
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex B1_UnifyUrshilaku == 1
ask Urshilaku Nerevarine
ask need
expect GetJournalIndex B1_UnifyUrshilaku == 5
ask curse of Dagoth Ur
expect GetJournalIndex B1_UnifyUrshilaku == 10
ask False Gods
expect GetJournalIndex B1_UnifyUrshilaku == 15
ask Moon-and-Star
expect GetJournalIndex B1_UnifyUrshilaku == 20
ask duty
expect GetJournalIndex B1_UnifyUrshilaku == 25
ask Urshilaku Nerevarine
expect GetJournalIndex B1_UnifyUrshilaku == 50
expect player->GetItemCount Teeth == 1
bye
end
